{
 "text": "CITY OF MANILA\nAGENCY ACTION PLAN AND STATUS of IMPLEMENTATION\nAudit Observations and Recommendations\nFor the Calendar Year 2023\nAs of 31 July 2024\nReference\nAAR 2023\nAudit Observations\n1. The accuracy of the Cash-In-Bank (CiB)\nObservation No. 1 accounts balance as of December 31, 2023,\nPage 79\namounting to P9.237 billion could not be\nestablished due to: 1) unreconciled variance of\nP106.634 million between books balances and\nthe result of bank confirmations, and 2)\naccumulated unadjusted book reconciling Items\nfor several years totaling P182.123 million,\nmainly due to lapses in the preparation and\nsubmission of Bank Reconcillation Statements\n(BRS) contrary to Section 74 of Presidential\nDecree (PD) No. 1445. Thus, affected the fair\npresentation of the FS.\nAudit Recommendations\nWe recommended and Management agreed\nthat the OCAT and the CTO:\n1.7.1. Reconcile the varlances between the\nbalances per bank confirmations and book\nbalance, and accordingly effect the necessary\nadjustments to reflect correct ending\nbalances of CIB accounts;\n1.7.2. Cause the timely preparation and\nsubmission of monthly BRSs for each bank\naccount pursuant to Section 74 of P.D. No.\n1445; and\n1.7.3, Formulate a document tracking system\nto establish accountability for records to\nprovide an effective internal control tool for\ndocumentation and recording of the City's\ntransactions.\nAAR 2023\n2. The accuracy, completeness, and reliability of We recommended that Management direct:\nObservation No. 2 the year-end balance of AP amounting to P4.577\nPage 82\nbillion could not be determined due to net\nunderstatement variance of P525.234 million\nfrom confirmation results with\ncontractors/suppllers as against balances per\nbooks contrary to Paragraph 27 of International\nPublic Sector Accounting Standard 1 (IPSAS).\nThus, affecting the fair presentation of the FS.\nThe OCAT to:\n2.9.1.1. Identify the causes of variances\nbetween recorded accounts payable and the\ncontractors/suppliers' confirmed balances\nand reconcile the same;\nAGENCY ACTION PLAN\nPerson/Dept.\nAction Plan\nResponsible\nTarget Implementation Date\nFrom\nTo\nStatus of\nImplementatlon\nReason for Partial/Delay/\nNon-Implementation, if\napplicable\nOCAT and CTО\n2023\n2024 Fully\nImplemented\nOCAT and CТО\n2023\n2024 Fully\nOCAT and CTO\n2023\n2024 Fully\nOCAT\n2023\nAction Taken/Action to\nbe Taken\nSubmitted the Bank\nReconcillation\nStatements for the CIB\nAccounts affected\nImplemented\nImplemented\nSubmitted the Bank\nReconciliation\nStatements for the CIB\nAccounts affected\nThe OCAT and CTO is\ncurrently Implementing\na document tracking\nsystem that will ensure\nthe proper and timely\nrecording of the\nfinancial transactions of\nthe City\n2024 Fully\nImplemented\nThe OCAT already\nundertaken actions to\nproperly account the\npayables per Suppller.\nThe amount of the\nvarlance is already\nrecorded thru JEV No,\n100-24-04-06 dated\nJune 15, 2024\n",
